README.md

# Runtime state, never build input.
#
# `data/` is gitignored and untracked on every dev machine, but the Dockerfile
# does `COPY . .`, so the host's live catalog (data/courses_db.json), log history
# and media cache were being copied into the builder layer and pushed to the
# registry as image layers -- publishing operator data and making the build
# non-reproducible (a host catalog could be baked in instead of the committed
# src/data copy, which is the only one that should ship).
data
data/**
